  "description": "As the deadly virus spreads all over the world, the minority who monopoly the wealth is transformed into an artificial body to envision survival and become a 'Syndicate' that is close to immortality. Those who're on the brink of being removed from the earth, which is dominated by the Syndicate are leave to universe, and some of them survive and set up a new base in here. Over time, mankind plans a war to regain the planet. In the preparation for war, the existence of 'Master' with special abilities is highlighted, and they stand at the center of the troop units...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://bufftoon.plaync.com/series/650576)  \n[Official English](https://m.tapas.io/series/RandB/info)\n\n*This work is one of a collaborations between [NCsoft](https://www.mangaupdates.com/publishers.html?id=1379) and [Lezhin Comics](https://www.mangaupdates.com/publishers.html?id=1004). It's a special webtoon that the author created the character based on the world view of game Master X Master.*",
